{
  "slug": "brooks-lint",
  "name": "Brooks Lint",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Code quality diagnosis using principles from six classic software engineering books (The Mythical Man-Month, Clean Code, A Philosophy of Software Design, Working Effectively with Legacy Code, xUnit Test Patterns, The Art of Unit Testing). Surfaces decay risks across four review modes: PR Review, Architecture Audit, Tech Debt Assessment, and Test Quality Review. Every finding follows the Iron Law: Symptom → Source → Consequence → Remedy — grounding each issue in a named principle from the books.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **5 agents**, **6 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `brooks-audit` (Architecture audit that maps module dependencies, checks layering integrity, and flags structural decay across a codebase, drawing on…), `brooks-debt` (Tech debt assessment that identifies, classifies, and prioritizes maintainability problems — helping teams build a refactoring roadmap —…), `brooks-health` (Combined codebase health dashboard that scores a project across all four quality dimensions — PR quality, architecture, tech…), `brooks-review` (PR code review that surfaces decay risks, design smells, and maintainability issues with concrete Symptom → Source →…), `brooks-sweep` (Full-sweep mode: runs a unified analysis across all quality dimensions — code decay, architecture, tech debt, and test…), `brooks-test` (Test quality review drawing on twelve classic engineering books — with primary focus on xUnit Test Patterns, The…)\n- **Agents** (5): `consistency-qa` (The brooks-lint verification gate), `eval-curator` (Authors and maintains the brooks-lint eval suite in evals/evals.json — the benchmark scenarios covering R1–R6 (code decay) and…), `release-manager` (Cuts a brooks-lint release: sets the version in package.json, propagates it across the four plugin manifests and every…), `skill-author` (Authors and edits brooks-lint skill content — the six shipped skills (skills/{name}/SKILL.md + {name}-guide.md) and the shared framework…), `trigger-boundary-auditor` (Audits the trigger boundaries of the six brooks-lint skills for false-triggering risk and routing collisions)\n- **Commands** (6): `brooks-audit` (Run a Brooks-Lint architecture audit), `brooks-debt` (Run a Brooks-Lint tech debt assessment), `brooks-health` (Run a Brooks-Lint codebase health dashboard across all four dimensions), `brooks-review` (Run a Brooks-Lint PR code review), `brooks-sweep` (Run all Brooks-Lint analyses in one pass, auto-fix safe findings, confirm risky ones), `brooks-test` (Run a Brooks-Lint test quality review)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install brooks-lint@claude-community` from `hyhmrright/brooks-lint`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
